Vulcan scatters ashes over Mexico City
Popocathepetal ash excavated from the volcano reached the southern neighborhoods of the capital of Mexico.
The National Disaster Prevention Center warned Mexican nationals on Saturday to stay away from the volcano after activity in the crater has risen and 183 gas and ash ejections have been recorded in the past 24 hours.
