Kanye West: Rapper changes name to Ye
Rapper Kanye West changed his name to Ye.
Along with the announcement of the change on Twitter on Saturday, he also wrote: “The man officially known as Kanye West.”
West, 41, has for some time carried the nickname Ye and used it as a title for his eighth album, which was released in June.
The change overtook his appearance on Saturday Night Live, where he is expected to present his new album Yandhi.
He replaced singer Ariana Grande on the show, which gave up “for emotional reasons,” the show’s creator tells us.
