“I believe ‘ye’ is the most commonly used word in the Bible, where it means ‘you’ or ‘you,’” West shared earlier this year while discussing the title of his album with radio host Big Boy.
“Thus I am you, I am us, it is us.
Pass from Kanye, which means only one person, just to Ye – which is a reflection of the good in our country, of evil, of confusion, of everything.
